      "html": "<div id=\"step-q125497\" class=\"step questionWidget\" stepid=\"q125497\" questionid=\"125497\" format=\"MC\" answer=\"\" current=\"false\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 3</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-125497\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Consider the vector field <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"42\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> shown above. Let <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"43\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> be the path where the semiellipse is traversed from <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"44\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"45\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Which of the following statements are true?</p>\n<ol class=\"questionStatements\"><li>  <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"46\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>d</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </li><li>  <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"47\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>d</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </li><li>  <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"48\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>d</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </li></ol></div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-125497-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">I only\n</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-125497-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">II and III only\n</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-125497-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">I and III only\n</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-125497-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">III only\n</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-125497-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\">II only</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p> Remember that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"49\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>d</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> gives the total work done by a force <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"50\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> in moving a particle along <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"51\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"BIN\"><mo>:</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>If the force works <em>with</em> the motion of the particle (i.e., the force helps to push the particle along the path), then <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"52\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>d</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>If the force works <em>against</em> the motion of the particle (i.e., the force impedes the motion of the particle as it moves along the path), then <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"53\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>d</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With that in mind, let's check each statement.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>Statement I is true while statement II is false. It's clear from the picture below that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> assists the motion of the particle as it moves from <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"56\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n</p><div id=\"graphic-q-125497-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-125497-e-0\"></div>\nSo, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"57\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mi>C</mi></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>d</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container><p></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Statement III is false. It's clear from the picture below that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"58\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> works against the motion of the particle as it moves from <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"59\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D435 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"60\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D434 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\n</p><div id=\"graphic-q-125497-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-125497-e-1\"></div>\nSo, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"61\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D405 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42B TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>d</mtext><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container><p></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n</div></div>",
